le":"Toshokan no Majo","altTitle":"The Library Witch","description":"Kirihito is a charcoal-burning boy living in a mountain village. His assigned mission: to serve the Library Witch, said to reside in the depths of the royal palace. A boy raised in the mountains and a voiceless witch—their encounter sets in motion a chain of events that will shake the kingdom and the world.\n\nThe highly popular, full-fledged fantasy series from Koudansha Books is finally getting a manga adaptation!\n___\n**Additional Links:**\n- [Official X](https://x.com/toshomajo_manga)","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Drama","Fantasy","Mystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/68d4f824-a5da-448e-83d6-cdd493a9f232/ae4a7995-48b2-45fc-b883-1af2ce551f23.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["es-la","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.93,"follows":409,"listAt":"2026-10-29T13:11:30.983Z","chapters":[{"id":"73dae719-d2b8-4be6-b81b-50b9f494b9b7","number":"2","volume":"1","title":"The Black Bird and the White Heron","lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2026-10-07T23:01:17+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"812e6fee-4172-49d0-9be4-de022cd4c439","number":"1","volume":"1","title":"The Witch of the High Tower","lang":"en","pages":62,"createdAt":"2026-10-03T03:58:11+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T07:32:03.174Z"},"2d63ef8c-eae6-44b4-a300-595b7de11516":{"id":"2d63ef8c-eae6-44b4-a300-595b7de11516","title":"Kanojo wo Dere saseru Houhou wo, Shourai Kekkon suru Ore dake ga Shitteiru","altTitle":"The Only One Who Knows How to Make Her Fall for Me Is the Future Me Who Marries Her","description":"T: Kenapa kamu memilih SMA ini?\nJ: Karena calon istriku akan bersekolah di sini.\n\nSaat terbangun, aku mendapati diriku telah kembali ke masa lalu 15 tahun. Di hadapanku berdiri Yuki, wanita yang kelak menjadi istriku, mengenakan seragam sekolah. Dalam alur waktu semula, kami baru akan bertemu setelah dewasa dan akhirnya menikah, jadi untuk saat ini kami masih orang asing. Namun, aku tahu bahwa Yuki tidak memercayai orang lain, tidak punya teman, dan menjalani masa sekolahnya seorang diri. Aku juga tahu bahwa suatu hari nanti ia akan sangat menyesali masa itu. Karena itulah kali ini aku akan menulis ulang masa mudanya. \"Kenapa kamu tahu rahasiaku?!\" \"Karena kita suami istri... di masa depan.\" Ini adalah kisah tentang bagaimana aku mewarnai kembali masa muda kelabu calon istriku dengan warnaku sendiri.","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Drama","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/2d63ef8c-eae6-44b4-a300-595b7de11516/7ab53b9d-6cb1-485b-a553-0a2f0052f4b8.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["es-la","vi","id","en","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.74,"follows":36398,"listAt":"2026-10-29T13:11:10.819Z","chapters":[{"id":"ea5a52c0-1a0c-4925-9012-c78d2b67aec8","number":"4","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2026-09-28T16:00:29+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"4b0616af-ded3-48a3-b268-0bb811fd9013","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":29,"createdAt":"2026-08-27T03:05:19+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"f987f6ac-641e-43bd-a240-3958f00d5a10","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2026-08-27T10:54:52+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"718d264d-8e83-4584-8ee3-db6b8229d920","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2026-07-27T15:14:20+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"93e196bb-a0a2-4c16-9402-6ef379c98bfc","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":40,"createdAt":"2026-07-27T20:25:55+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"ab465402-7a0b-40cc-86f0-7290d6b24e31","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":42,"createdAt":"2026-06-29T15:04:37+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"f020657e-0c3d-4d37-bff8-f9bfd992c6eb","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"